WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — Revenge of the Wave God — Episode 7 — English subtitles — translation of the actual spoken Arabic dialogue (language: en)
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-24 from the real episode audio (whisper-small + manual cleanup).

1
00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:04.130
Ammar, my board fell.

2
00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:07.130
Will you win the gold at the championship this year?

3
00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:09.130
Of course, I'll definitely win it.

4
00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:12.130
He's much more handsome in person.

5
00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:13.130
She used to date him.

6
00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:15.130
Because he was special.

7
00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:18.130
How could you let a man like him go?

8
00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:22.130
Are we going to surf some waves? What?

9
00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:26.130
I think Najwa needs to see me surf.

10
00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:29.130
And since Ammar loves their family, he'll help us.

11
00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:30.130
For the surfing.

12
00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.130
You don't mind, right?

13
00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:32.130
That's fine.

14
00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.130
We'll celebrate our wedding anniversary tonight.

15
00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:36.920
Let's go.

16
00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:48.230
What does all this mean?

17
00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:50.230
In perfect harmony.

18
00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:51.230
They say they love each other.

19
00:00:51.230 --> 00:01:01.700
Which one is your wife?

20
00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:04.700
The one on the board with Ammar.

21
00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:06.700
And she's very interesting.

22
00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:07.700
She's truly talented.

23
00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:08.700
She's the best.

24
00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:14.510
Coco Maple is looking after me.

25
00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:15.510
Yes.

26
00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:17.510
I'll help you take care of her.

27
00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:19.510
Thank you, Ammar.

28
00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:20.510
I'll manage.

29
00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:22.510
I'm not a child.

30
00:01:22.510 --> 00:01:28.450
I know exactly who you are.

31
00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:30.450
I remember every detail about you.

32
00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:32.450
And I long to relive our memories.

33
00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:34.450
I want to help you.

34
00:01:34.450 --> 00:01:36.450
Since your husband is incapable of that.

35
00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:37.450
Hey, buddy.

36
00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:40.370
You must be Hossam.

37
00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:42.370
The sponge surfer.

38
00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:44.370
I'm Lujain's husband.

39
00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:51.040
Did you bring her board?

40
00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:57.300
Five years.

41
00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:59.300
For five whole years.

42
00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:00.300
I protected you and loved you.

43
00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:02.300
But I'm starting to see that you…

44
00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:03.300
…don't love me back.
